WEBVTT

00:07:29.996 --> 00:07:34.156
and what it said was "Thank you
for your cooperation with us.

00:07:34.596 --> 00:07:36.676
As a result of cooperating with you,

00:07:36.716 --> 00:07:41.596
we have brought, in 2020 alone,

00:07:41.636 --> 00:07:45.116
over 80,000 environmental cases."

00:07:45.436 --> 00:07:46.596
Audience: Whoa.

00:07:46.636 --> 00:07:52.356
(Applause)

00:07:52.396 --> 00:07:56.236
80,000 cases, and the majority
of those cases

00:07:56.236 --> 00:07:59.676
were brought against
government departments.